<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6051] Default Notebooks getting corrupted</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6051</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Default notebooks are getting corrupted. Getting the following error while trying to access the corrupted notebook or while trying to open the JOB page.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
