&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Slack link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://the-asf.slack.com/archives/C4RDKR51R/p1723197112801869&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://the-asf.slack.com/archives/C4RDKR51R/p1723197112801869&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
